Families in Western New York, and across our nation, are living through a full-blown healthcare crisis.

Under Trump and Congressional Republicans, patients are facing skyrocketing premiums and losing access to care because of devastating federal cuts. To make matters worse, they’ve made it nearly impossible for future nurses, therapists, counselors, and other essential providers to afford their education, deepening an already dire workforce shortage.

@HouseDemocrats won’t stand by while healthcare is stripped away from working families. We’re fighting to protect patients, safeguard providers, and ensure healthcare is a right for all – not a luxury – in the richest nation on Earth.
